sequenceDiagram
    actor Presenter
    participant Flo as Flo / Studio backend
    participant AI as Gate 1 / AI adapter
    participant LLM as Hosted LLM
    participant MCP as Gate 2 / MCP adapter
    participant OPA
    participant Bank as Gate 3 / Core Banking
    Presenter->>Flo: Ask Flo to review the case
    Flo->>MCP: Read case-502
    MCP->>OPA: Evaluate case-read permission
    OPA-->>MCP: Allow
    MCP->>Bank: Authorized case read
    Bank-->>MCP: Case data
    MCP-->>Flo: Untrusted case text
    Flo->>AI: Instructions, minimal case context, tool schema
    AI->>LLM: Bounded inference request
    LLM-->>AI: Refusal or payment proposal
    AI-->>Flo: Model response
    alt No tool proposed
        Flo-->>Presenter: No tool proposed
    else Valid payment proposal
        Flo->>MCP: Submit validated payment arguments
        MCP->>OPA: Evaluate signed role, amount, beneficiary
        OPA-->>MCP: Policy decision
        alt Allow
            MCP->>Bank: Authorized payment request
            Bank-->>MCP: Banking result
        else Approval required
            MCP->>Bank: Persist pending proposal
            Bank-->>MCP: Proposal ID and pending status
        else Deny
            Note over MCP,Bank: No payment execution request forwarded
        end
        MCP-->>Flo: Actual execution, approval or denial result
        Flo-->>Presenter: Show evidence
    end
    Note over AI,LLM: Gate 1 has no dedicated<br/>prompt-injection detector<br/>in this lab
